# The Zeruhn Report (Bastok 1-1, mission.bastok.the_zeruhn_report): begun in Metalworks. A level 10 Warrior of
# Bastok (rank 1, no mission; a GM's Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1's 30035 out of the login). Section 1: Malduc's
# 1000; finished with 0: Metalworks' own 1000 registration (handleAcceptMission): begun, YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION.
# Section 2: Malduc's ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET (Metalworks' is 14). (The main flow begins at Port Bastok's Argus; in
# C# each zone's 1000 finish is its own registration.) No timing or RNG dependency.
lists Metalworks/Malduc/onTrigger Metalworks/onEventFinish/1000
char zone=Metalworks pos=64,-14,-4 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
login
trigger Malduc                          # section 1: 1000
finish option=0                         # 0: begun, YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION
trigger Malduc                          # section 2: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET
